      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Viktor tells the kitchen staff to leave through the back and front doors. But the back door is blocked. An immigration major introduces himself to Viktor. Let us listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Попробуй новый вариант блюда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Шеф, выход через зал закрыт.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Мы выходим по одному человеку.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Половина идёт через зал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что вы за идиоты?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Быстро ко мне в кабинет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lanovsky",
      "t": "Добрый день, Виктор Петрович.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lanovsky",
      "t": "Я майор миграционной службы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lanovsky",
      "t": "Мы можем пройти в кабинет?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "К сожалению, я не могу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Мне нужно готовить для гостей.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lanovsky",
      "t": "Хорошо, я подожду вас здесь.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let us examine the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Попробуй новый вариант блюда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Try the new version of the dish.' Max shoves another plate forward, asking for a fresh taste test of his updated attempt.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Шеф, выход через зал закрыт.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, the exit through the hall is closed.' Warning the boss, the young cook points out that their usual escape route is blocked.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Мы выходим по одному человеку.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We exit one person at a time.' Barinov takes control of the panic, ordering his team to leave the room singly.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Половина идёт через зал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Half goes through the hall.' Directing the flow of traffic, he tells fifty percent of them to take the main route.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что вы за идиоты?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What kind of idiots are you?' Losing his temper, the chef yells at his staff for acting foolishly during the crisis.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Быстро ко мне в кабинет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Quickly to my office.' Demanding immediate action, he tells them to rush into his private workspace.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lanovsky",
      "t": "Добрый день, Виктор Петрович.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good afternoon, Viktor Petrovich.' Lanovsky enters politely, offering a formal greeting to the man in charge.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lanovsky",
      "t": "Я майор миграционной службы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am a major of the migration service.' Introducing himself, the visitor states his rank and government agency.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lanovsky",
      "t": "Мы можем пройти в кабинет?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can we go to the office?' Requesting a private space, the official asks if they can move into the back room.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "К сожалению, я не могу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Unfortunately, I cannot.' Barinov politely declines, claiming he is too tied up with his current duties.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Мне нужно готовить для гостей.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I need to cook for the guests.' Providing an excuse, the chef explains that he has to finish preparing meals for the patrons.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "lanovsky",
      "t": "Хорошо, я подожду вас здесь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, I will wait for you here.' Lanovsky calmly accepts the delay, stating he is perfectly fine staying right where he is. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
