      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Viktor tells the kitchen staff to leave through the back and front doors. But the back door is blocked. An immigration major introduces himself to Viktor. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'to try' and 'new' — you will catch every word right away. See you next time!",
